{
    "0": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah,"
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Were there houses in a place like this?"
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Straying into here means the end!"
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Black Cat of Ill Omen",
                "Chen"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "End?"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well anyways, welcome to Mayohiga."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, the end of what?"
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Once you wander in, you can't leave."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is that so."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That reminds me, I'd heard that items from Mayohiga..."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...will make you lucky if you take them home..."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's right."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then time to start pillaging!"
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "W-what?"
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is our home. ",
                "Would you mind leaving, human?"
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So what happened to ",
                "\"Once you wander in, you can't leave\"?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now then,"
            ]
        },
        "60_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's look for some useful and easy-to-carry things."
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah..."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Seems like somethin' at least sorta human might live here."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Like a cat maybe. Or a dog. Or a fox."
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<i$Springing to your call...>\u0014(TL note: The first half of the catchphrase for when the genie jumps out of the lamp in the anime Hakushon Dai-maou. The implied other half is the \"ta-dah!\" for Chen's entrance.)"
            ]
        },
        "103_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Black Cat of Ill Omen",
                "Chen"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...And what springs out gets hammered down, right?"
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well? What's your business here?"
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nothing concernin' you four-legged things."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You've lost your way, haven't you?",
                "That's what ending up at the Village of the Lost means."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There wasn't a way to lose."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Visibility was poor in that snowstorm,",
                "and the wind was changing by the moment..."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, the wind was changin'?",
                "Figures."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I bet you don't even know your way back anymore!"
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Figures."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Figures,"
            ]
        },
        "60_1": {
            "lines": [
                "that I run into some rando."
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It really should be spring by now..."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Or maybe I'm just going crazy."
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In that case, you'd better ask a human for help!"
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Black Cat of Ill Omen",
                "Chen"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But you're not a human."
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I wouldn't have an answer even if you'd asked me."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In days like this,"
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Cats are supposed to docilely curl up",
                "beneath a kotatsu."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You shouldn't believe such superstitions!"
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "(I didn't know it was just a superstition...)"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are stray cats to do, then?"
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why not get put to sleep at an animal shelter?"
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Buddhist Paradise is warm, they say."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Humans? Posing a threat to us?"
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Impossible, impossible, absolutely impossible!",
                "To think that you would oppose us..."
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I—for one—would like to give it a try."
            ]
        }
    },
    "21": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Amen."
            ]
        },
        "60_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Paradise should definitely be warm,",
                "no mistake about it."
            ]
        }
    }
}